#: templates/legal/privacy_policy.html:175
#: templates/legal/privacy_policy.html:228
#: templates/legal/privacy_policy.html:304
#: templates/legal/privacy_policy.html:323
msgid "Data transfer"
msgstr "Datenübermittlung"

#: templates/legal/privacy_policy.html:176
msgid ""
"\n"
"                Data may be transferred to Google LLC (USA).\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Daten können an Google LLC (USA) übertragen werden."

#: templates/legal/privacy_policy.html:181
#: templates/legal/privacy_policy.html:234
#: templates/legal/privacy_policy.html:329
msgid ""
"\n"
"                Where data is transferred to countries outside the European Union for which no adequacy\n"
"                decision of the European Commission exists, we implement appropriate safeguards such as\n"
"                standard contractual clauses in accordance with Art. 46 GDPR and, where necessary,\n"
"                additional technical and organisational measures to protect your data.\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Bei Datenübermittlungen in Länder außerhalb der Europäischen Union, für die keine Angemessenheitsentscheidung\n"
"der Europäischen Kommission vorliegt, setzen wir geeignete Garantien wie\n"
"Standardvertragsklauseln gemäß Art. 46 DSGVO und, falls erforderlich,\n"
"zusätzliche technische und organisatorische Maßnahmen zum Schutz Ihrer Daten ein."

#: templates/legal/privacy_policy.html:190
#: templates/legal/privacy_policy.html:242
