#: templates/legal/privacy_policy.html:203
msgid ""
"\n"
"                We receive from GitHub your username, email address and a unique GitHub user ID.\n"
"                This data is used solely to create and manage your user account on MentoroAI and to authenticate you when you log in.\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"\n"
